      "urpx:hasCoverageClaim": {
        "@id": "jemc:cc-atou-2026-01-01",
        "@type": "urpx:CoverageClaim",
        "urpx:completenessResult": {
          "@id": "urpx:partial"
        },
        "urpx:selfContained": true,
        "urpx:explainedBy": {
          "@type": "urpx:Evaluation",
          "@id": "jemc:cc-atou-2026-01-01-evaluation",
          "urpx:evaluationKind": {
            "@id": "urpx:coverageEvaluation"
          },
          "urpx:description": "This filing does not carry everything its source document states. 4 parts are deferred, listed here in the same words as the filing's tariff.toml [modeling].deferrals so the two records cannot drift. (1) On-Peak through September 15. The sheet's On-Peak hours, 3:00 to 8:00 p.m. on weekdays, run from June 1 through September 15. The JSON-LD's Summer Season is the calendar months June through September, so weekday afternoons from September 16 through 30 take the On-Peak price, 27.00 cents per kWh above the Off-Peak price the sheet charges for them. (2) Wholesale Power Cost Adjustment factor. Schedule P-22 increases or decreases every bill by a per-kWh factor the Cooperative computes each month from its estimated purchased-power costs and sales, and publishes no factor. The JSON-LD defines the adjustment as a per-kWh PriceDefinition with no Price, so a modeled bill carries the base energy and Service Charges only, high or low by the month's factor times its kWh. (3) Owner-occupied single-family dwellings. The sheet limits the schedule to single-family dwelling units owned and occupied by the customer for permanent year-round service. The EligibilityRule carries residential customer kind; this condition is in its description only. (4) Budget Billing, Terms of Payment and Contract Period. The sheet requires twelve consecutive months of service beginning June 1st of each year, offers a levelized budget bill with the Cooperative's approval, adds a late fee and disconnection charges under its Service Rules and Regulations, makes all charges subject to applicable taxes, and sets a one-year contract. None is priced on the sheet and none is carried.",
          "urpx:evaluatedOn": "2026-10-18T00:00:00"
        }
      }
    }
  }
